# Netlify Redirects File
# This handles SPA routing for React Router

# Redirect all routes to index.html for client-side routing
/*    /index.html   200

# Optional: Force HTTPS redirect
# Uncomment the line below if you want to force HTTPS
# http://* https://:splat 301!

# Optional: www to non-www redirect
# Uncomment if you want to redirect www to non-www
# https://www.yourdomain.com/* https://yourdomain.com/:splat 301!
